  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender And Faith Network Coordination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to address the persistent gender inequalities in Zimbabwe by investing in capacity building on gender equality and women&apos;s empowerment within the country&apos;s influential religious institutions i.e. the Gender Faith Network. The main strategies and actions of the project include a.) investing in capacity building on gender equality and women empowerment within the religious institutions; b.) prioritizing research, lobby, and advocacy to transform policies and practices on addressing gender equality and women empowerment and c.) strengthening the institutional capacities for the Gender and Faith Network (GFN).</narrative>
  </description>
